abstract: >-
  A portable browser workbench for declared-framework corpus analysis,
  exact-source evidence, attribution, contextual model readings,
  review histories, trajectories and reproducible research publications.
  Processing coverage and source anchoring do not establish interpretation accuracy.
keywords:
  - discourse analysis
  - political framing
  - prejudice indicators
  - evidence provenance
  - human review
